        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A relation that gives the name a simulation program uses for the concept the annotated term stands for, as that name appears in the program&apos;s input file, output file or command line. The program the name belongs to is recorded as the source of each such statement, so 1 property serves every program. (UNVERIFIED)</obo:IAO_0000115>
