        <obo:IAO_0000115>A nucleotide modified by methylation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>methylated base feature</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>sequence</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
